          deckDescription: 'The deck is a double twenty-four-card pack: two identical copies of each card, giving forty-eight cards total, with six ranks (Ace, 10, King, Ober, Unter, 7) in four German suits.',
          suitDescription: 'The four German suits are Hearts (Herz), Bells (Schellen), Acorns (Eichel), and Leaves (Grün); the game is traditionally played with the Württemberg or similar German-suited pattern.',
